{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/13119-rank-6-crypids","id":13119,"title":"Rank 6 Crypids","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-17T19:10:35-08:00","id":13119,"title":"Rank 6 Crypids","content":"Okay the preview says that rank 6 cryptids are the result of a otherworldly creature like something from the hedge or the shadow being infused with the god-machine's power.<br /> <br /> The hedge is easy, hobgoblins are as a rule physical creatures but the shadow?<br /> <br /> I'm not aware of the shadow having any occupants other than immigrants from the physical world and spirits, so does that mean that spirits become solid creatures from becoming cryptids?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-17T21:35:05-08:00","id":13169,"title":"","content":"inb4 someone says werewolves are just cryptids<br /> <br /> But seriously, spirits of decent rank have physical forms within the Shadow, and can become as physical as a person in the real world through manifestation. So it does seem like that's what its referring to. I'd suggest gaining cryptid status just lets them stay manifested (the explanation does say they're not made for it and tend to die quick).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 11-18-2013, 12:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather